  Copyright (c) 2026 Thomas Übermeier (https://github.com/its-a-unixsystem)
  Licensed under the MIT License.

  Changes from omp-claude-bridge:
    - Ported the provider and AskClaude to the Oh My Pi 19.2 extension API.
    - Gave each OMP provider session its own Claude Code session, so
      subagents and side requests no longer share the main agent's state.

